_line":6,"start_character":0,"end_line":6,"end_character":31},"source_text":"மரைஇலை போல மாய்ந்திசினோர் பலரே:"}],"supporting_assertion_ids":[],"assertion_provenance_status":"direct_r15_source_review_no_prior_assertion","confidence":"high","review_status":"reviewed","reviewer_type":"assistant_assisted","historical_identity_status":"not_applicable","note":"Source-explicit evidence retained without external expansion."},{"observation_id":"obs.prod.r15.e74261a36f9516e7be5cd670","dimension":"people_social_roles","concept_id":null,"evidence_class":"SOURCE_EXPLICIT","classification_basis":"direct_record_review","evidence_refs":[{"source_field":"canonical_body","source_location":"markdown:canonical-body","evidence_span":{"start_line":3,"start_character":0,"end_line":10,"end_character":39},"source_text":"வேற்றுமை ‘இல்லா விழுத்திணைப் பிறந்து,\nவீற்றிருந் தோரை எண்ணுங் காலை,\nஉரையும் பாட்டும் உடையோர் சிலரே;\nமரைஇலை போல மாய்ந்திசினோர் பலரே:\n‘புலவர் பாடும் புகழுடையோர் விசும்பின்\nவலவன் ஏவா வான ஊர்தி\nஎய்துப என்ப, தம் செய்வினை முடித்து’ எனக்\nகேட்பல்; எந்தை! சேட்சென்னி! நலங்கிள்ளி!"},{"source_field":"canonical_body","source_location":"markdown:canonical-body","evidence_span":{"start_line":15,"start_character":0,"end_line":18,"end_character":21},"source_text":"வல்லார் ஆயினும், வல்லுநர் ஆயினும்,\nவருந்தி வந்தோர் மருங்கு நோக்கி,\nஅருள வல்லை ஆகுமதி; அருளிலர்\nகொடா அமை வல்லர் ஆகுக;"}],"supporting_assertion_ids":[],"assertion_provenance_status":"direct_r15_source_review_no_prior_assertion","confidence":"high","review_status":"reviewed","reviewer_type":"assistant_assisted","historical_identity_status":"not_applicable","note":"Source-explicit evidence retained without external expansion."},{"observation_id":"obs.prod.r15.23a4d6f215bbd4ebc53769e5","dimension":"relationships","concept_id":null,"evidence_class":"SOURCE_EXPLICIT","classification_basis":"direct_record_review","evidence_refs":[{"source_field":"canonical_body","source_location":"markdown:canonical-body","evidence_span":{"start_l